{"page": 88, "lines": [{"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 263.0, "y": 92.0}, {"t": "MAILDROP OPERATION", "x": 1516.0, "y": 100.0}, {"t": "5.4. 3", "x": 264.0, "y": 211.0}, {"t": "5.4. 4", "x": 249.0, "y": 1616.0}, {"t": "12/91", "x": 243.0, "y": 2547.0}, {"t": "(EDIT (SYSOP only command)", "x": 515.0, "y": 217.0}, {"t": "The Edit command (Host abbreviation E 1) is a powerful tool for", "x": 467.0, "y": 293.0}, {"t": "controlling the status of messages on your Mail Drop. The SYSOP must", "x": 467.0, "y": 336.0}, {"t": "access the Mail Drop before typing this command.", "x": 467.0, "y": 377.0}, {"t": "Here are all possible", "x": 1456.0, "y": 378.0}, {"t": "ways to use", "x": 465.0, "y": 417.0}, {"t": "this command:", "x": 712.0, "y": 417.0}, {"t": "WORM", "x": 706.0, "y": 776.0}, {"t": "WHIZ", "x": 706.0, "y": 817.0}, {"t": "N7ML", "x": 706.0, "y": 857.0}, {"t": "N7ML.MT.NA", "x": 706.0, "y": 897.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 566.0, "y": 735.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 566.0, "y": 776.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 564.0, "y": 857.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 564.0, "y": 897.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 561.0, "y": 1096.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 560.0, "y": 1177.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 560.0, "y": 1218.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 560.0, "y": 1258.0}, {"t": "E", "x": 559.0, "y": 1298.0}, {"t": "12", "x": 608.0, "y": 734.0}, {"t": "48", "x": 605.0, "y": 856.0}, {"t": "49", "x": 605.0, "y": 895.0}, {"t": "58", "x": 603.0, "y": 1095.0}, {"t": "61", "x": 602.0, "y": 1175.0}, {"t": "62", "x": 602.0, "y": 1217.0}, {"t": "63", "x": 601.0, "y": 1257.0}, {"t": "64", "x": 601.0, "y": 1297.0}, {"t": ">", "x": 666.0, "y": 779.0}, {"t": "B", "x": 663.0, "y": 1178.0}, {"t": "T", "x": 661.0, "y": 1218.0}, {"t": "Y", "x": 662.0, "y": 1259.0}, {"t": "Shows the following short help file:", "x": 974.0, "y": 496.0}, {"t": "E msg#", "x": 1073.0, "y": 537.0}, {"t": "E msg# B/ T/ P", "x": 1073.0, "y": 576.0}, {"t": "E msg# Y/N/F", "x": 1072.0, "y": 616.0}, {"t": "E msg# >/</@ callsign", "x": 1072.0, "y": 656.0}, {"t": "Shows message 12' s info line.", "x": 971.0, "y": 736.0}, {"t": "Sets \"WORM\" as message 23' s destination.", "x": 971.0, "y": 777.0}, {"t": "Sets \"WHIZ\" as message 35' s source.", "x": 971.0, "y": 818.0}, {"t": "Sets \"N7ML\" as message 48 •s destination BBS.", "x": 971.0, "y": 857.0}, {"t": "Sets \"N7ML\" as message 49' s destination BBS.", "x": 971.0, "y": 897.0}, {"t": "and adds the hierarchical forwarding", "x": 971.0, "y": 937.0}, {"t": "information . MT. NA signifying that N7ML BBS", "x": 972.0, "y": 977.0}, {"t": "is located in the state of Montana (MT)", "x": 972.0, "y": 1017.0}, {"t": "which is located in North America (NA) .", "x": 969.0, "y": 1056.0}, {"t": "Clears message 58' s destination BBS field.", "x": 969.0, "y": 1096.0}, {"t": "status to Private.", "x": 1333.0, "y": 1137.0}, {"t": "Sets message 60's", "x": 969.0, "y": 1138.0}, {"t": "status to Bulletin.", "x": 1334.0, "y": 1177.0}, {"t": "Sets message 61' s", "x": 969.0, "y": 1178.0}, {"t": "status to Traffic.", "x": 1334.0, "y": 1218.0}, {"t": "Sets message 62 's", "x": 969.0, "y": 1220.0}, {"t": "status to Has—Been—Read.", "x": 1334.0, "y": 1258.0}, {"t": "Sets message 63 's", "x": 969.0, "y": 1260.0}, {"t": "status to Has—Not—Been—Read.", "x": 1334.0, "y": 1298.0}, {"t": "Sets message 64's", "x": 969.0, "y": 1300.0}, {"t": "status to Reverse Forward.", "x": 1334.0, "y": 1339.0}, {"t": "Sets message 49 's", "x": 968.0, "y": 1340.0}, {"t": "The command", "x": 455.0, "y": 1416.0}, {"t": "\"E n F\" sets the message status to enable Reverse", "x": 705.0, "y": 1420.0}, {"t": "Forwarding of a message number. To cancel forwarding, set the status", "x": 455.0, "y": 1457.0}, {"t": "to either \"Y\" or \"N. \"", "x": 454.0, "y": 1496.0}, {"t": "Please read the section on Reverse Forwarding", "x": 927.0, "y": 1498.0}, {"t": "(below) if you are interested in this feature.", "x": 459.0, "y": 1537.0}, {"t": "( HELP) ( Remote only command)", "x": 499.0, "y": 1620.0}, {"t": "The \"H\" command sends the distant station a HELP list of all 